<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Interpump coverage initiated. [CORRECTED 14:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Interpump coverage initiated. [CORRECTED 14:00 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it had initiated coverage of Italian pump and piston group Interpump with a &quot;market outperformer&quot; rating on Tuesday. (Corrects rating)</p>
<p>The investment bank gave the shares a twelve month price target of 6,300 lire per share.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 4027</p>
